      "definition": "added to an adjective to make a noun naming the quality or state that the adjective describes",
      "explanation": "Adjectives in **-able** and **-ible** that take it end in **-ability** and **-ibility** (*stable*, *stability*; *possible*, *possibility*), and some adjectives change more (*curious*, *curiosity*; *generous*, *generosity*). Many adjectives take **-ness** instead, so check before making an **-ity** word.",
